pany CGE Transmission S.A. sends the background associated to the proposed physical phenomenon for the origin of the failure, in accordance with Resolution Exenta 30989-2019 of the Superintendency of Electricity and Fuels: or Maintenances of the last 24 months made in the equipment or element where the failure occurs. or Technical report explaining the possible causes that promote the failure of material. or Technical report of the possible causes that explain the failure of material. or Photographic record with date, time and coordinates UTM. or Effective year of commissioning and effective year","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 408/2024\n\u201cFalla en el cierre de interruptor 52C5 de S/E Coronel\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 26-08-2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 04/08/2024\nHora 06:03\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 4.70\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 7727\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.061 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n S/E Coronel / SE142T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 154, 66, 15 y 13.2 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, piso 14, Las Condes\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento fallado Interruptor 52C5 de S/E Coronel / IM01T0058PA013T0058SE142T0058\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, piso 14, Las Condes\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo una falla en el cierre del interruptor 52C5 de S/E Coronel durante maniobras de\nrecuperaci\u00f3n de servicio tras evento ocurrido en redes de distribuci\u00f3n, espec\u00edficamente en el\nalimentador La Obra, protegido por el mencionado interruptor.\nLa causa de la falla se debi\u00f3 a un bloqueo mec\u00e1nico.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE10: Falla de material, por fatiga, corrosi\u00f3n, trizadura, etc.\nLa empresa CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. env\u00eda los antecedentes asociados al fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico propuesto para\nel origen de la falla, de acuerdo con la Resoluci\u00f3n Exenta 30989-2019 de la Superintendencia de\nElectricidad y Combustibles:\no Mantenimientos de los \u00faltimos 24 meses realizados en el equipo o elemento donde se produce\nla falla.\no","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.03},{"w":"fault","s":-0.1},{"w":"analysis","s":-0.04},{"w":"eaf","s":-0.06},{"w":"2024","s":0.17},{"w":"fault","s":-0.1},{"w":"switch","s":1.0},{"w":"date","s":0.12},{"w":"description","s":0.01},{"w":"date","s":0.12},{"w":"time","s":0.11},{"w":"failure","s":-0.06},{"w":"date","s":0.12},{"w":"04","s":-0.06},{"w":"08","s":-0.17},{"w":"2024","s":0.17},{"w":"time","s":0.11},{"w":"03","s":-0.16},{"w":"mw","s":-0.02},{"w":"prior","s":0.05},{"w":"mw","s":-0.02},{"w":"percentage","s":0.12},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.12},{"w":"percentage","s":0.12},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.12}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.2749,"breaker_fault":0.701,"transformer_fault":0.0094,"busbar_fault":0.0147},"confidence":0.701,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.1331,"breaker_fault":0.5153,"transformer_fault":0.213,"busbar_fault":0.1386},"confidence":0.5153,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.0589,"breaker_fault":0.6364,"transformer_fault":0.1162,"busbar_fault":0.1885},"confidence":0.6364,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modali